   164	def main(grid: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:
   165	    """
   166	    Delete legend-matching components, repack the survivors, and crop to the new collage.
   167	
   168	    Input structure:
   169	    - The canvas is mostly background.
   170	    - A top-left legend is marked by a shared-color bottom edge and right edge; its interior displays the target palette.
   171	    - All other foreground shapes are separate multicolor 4-connected components on the background.
   172	
   173	    Rule:
   174	    - Read the legend's target color set from the interior of the top-left marker.
   175	    - Remove every non-background 4-connected component whose color set contains all target colors.
   176	    - Keep every other component, sort the survivors by their original top-left position, and move them into a compact left-top packing with 1-cell gaps.
